                    rdf:value "Selected strategies are Connectome Computation System (CCS), Conﬁgurable Pipeline for the Analysis of Con- nectomes (CPAC), Data Processing Assistant for Resting-State fMRI (DPARSF) and Neuroimaging Analysis Kit (NIAK)." ] ;
