        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "all the fMRI images are preprocessed by the Data Processing Assistant for Resting- State fMRI (DPARSF) software (Cui et al., 2015) (http://d.rnet. co/DPABI/DPABI_V2.3_170105.zip). The whole preprocessing procedures include:(1) Converting DICOM to NIFTI, (2) Removing the ﬁrst 10 time points, (3) Slicing timing, (4) Realigning, (5) Normalizing with the echo-planar imaging (EPI) template, (6) Smoothing, (7) Removing the linear trend, (8) Temporal ﬁltering, (9) Removing covariates." ] ;
            oa:hasTarget <https://doi.org/10.3389/fgene.2018.00018> ;
