        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "Motion scrubbing (Power et al., 2012) of framewise dis- placement and DVARS with removal of volumes before and after a root-mean-square displace" ] ;
            oa:hasTarget <https://doi.org/10.3389/fnhum.2013.00599> ;
            slr:claim_label "Motion was handled via framewise-displacement/DVARS-based scrubbing of individual volumes." ;
            slr:relevance_score "0.6"^^xsd:float ],
        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value """In the ABIDE cohort, when we trained and
tested on data with similar distributions (first column), the contiguous scheme reached better
prediction performance than the diverse scheme, with the random scheme lying in between.
