(3D) form. MRIcron software was used to convert the 
3D data format into 2D data images.""" ] ;
            oa:hasTarget <https://doi.org/10.11113/jurnalteknologi.v83.16389> ;
            slr:claim_label "Raw 3D NIfTI volumes were converted to 2D images with MRIcron rather than processed through a connectivity pipeline." ;
            slr:relevance_score "0.8"^^xsd:float ],
        [ a oa:Annotation ;
            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "We apply DeepASD to the benchmarking Autism Brain Imaging Data Exchange (ABIDE) data with four modalities." ] ;
