            oa:hasBody [ a dcterms:Text ;
                    rdf:value "The top single model trained using IMPAC attained 80.4% AUROC on IMPAC held-out test data. When tested on ABIDE I, it achieved an AUROC of 86.0% (Table 2 underlined) and when tested on the ABIDE II it achieved a performance of 79.2%." ] ;
