    slr:reporting_standard "PRISMA_2020" ;
    slr:research_question "Characterise how published studies use the Autism Brain Imaging Data Exchange (ABIDE I and ABIDE II) resting-state fMRI releases: which subsets and quality-control rules define the analysed cohorts, which preprocessing pipelines and parcellations are used, whether the main claim is associational (group difference) or predictive (diagnostic classification/regression), how it is evaluated, what is found, and whether the analysed cohort can be reconstructed from released files, so that each publication can be linked to the dataset subset it used in a knowledge graph." ;
