                    slr:supporting_quote "ABIDE cohort composition, sites, and the train/hold-out split (preserving case:control ratio) are explicit: \"The ABIDE dataset consists of 1111 scans, taken from 17 sites consisting of 573 healthy controls and 538 patients with autism. To evaluate each learning model, we use 800 subjects (70%) for model training and 311 subjects (30%) for hold-out testing. We use the same case/control ratio (0.5157) for both training and test set.\"" ],
