                    slr:judgment "low" ;
                    slr:supporting_quote "ABIDE I/II inclusion rule and resulting N are explicit: \"Participants from all sites of the ABIDE I and ABIDE II were included for external validation, provided both sMRI and rsfMRI were obtained on the same visit. The first avail- able pair of sMRI and rsfMRI scans were used per subject. 1045 subjects from ABIDE I and 761 subjects from ABIDE II met this criteria.\"" ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
