                    slr:supporting_quote "Total N (816), site distribution and age-group stratification are tabulated, with an explicit zero-time-series exclusion rule: \"Any subject that had a consistently 0 time-series was omitted from the dataset.\" (exact ASD/HC split is reported only in a supplementary table not captured in the extracted text)." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
