                    slr:judgment "unclear" ;
                    slr:supporting_quote "Diagnosis source is not described in this paper beyond citing the ABIDE release and its diagnostic categories (autism, Asperger, PDD-NOS)." ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
                    slr:domain_name "Analysis" ;
                    slr:judgment "low" ;
                    slr:supporting_quote "Both 5-fold CV (with a validation split separate from the test fold) and an independent leave-site-out CV across the five largest sites are reported, directly exposing the gap between pooled and cross-site generalisation: \"The overall best performing model was the MM-ensemble, which achieved balanced accuracy of 64% and F1 score of 66%, averaged over the ﬁve-folds of the CV procedure. With the leave- site-out CV procedure the performance of the MM-ensemble dropped to an average balanced accuracy of mean 56% and F1 score of 59%, suggesting that this model does not do well in generalizing to new sites.\"" ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
                    slr:domain_name "Predictors" ;
                    slr:judgment "low" ;
                    slr:supporting_quote "Pipeline (C-PAC, following a published Preprocessed Connectomes Project strategy chosen explicitly for replicability) is specified: \"The preprocessing was done using the Conﬁgurable Pipeline for the Analysis of Connectomes (C-PAC, (12). We followed a preprocessing strategy adopted by the Preprocessed Connectome Project initiative3. This will allow others to replicate and extend the ﬁndings in this paper.\"" ],
