                    slr:supporting_quote "The rs-fMRI scans selected from ABIDE I and ABIDE II cohorts were processed with the Configurable Pipe- line for the Analysis of Connectomes (C-PAC) [20] The Harvard-Oxford (HO) atlas was used to extract time series from brain regions, obtaining 110 timeseries for each subject. 62 structures (31 per hemisphere) from the Desikan-Killiany- Tourville Atlas" ],
                [ a slr:RoBDomainJudgment ;
