            slr:answer_text "ABIDE I+II, 35 sites, 1383 males aged 5-40 (680 ASD/703 TD) after excluding subjects with missing multimodal data | quote: \"we obtained a final sample of 1383 subjects (680 ASD and 703 TD) from 35 sites.\"" ;
