            slr:answer_text "ABIDE I, 17 sites; DPARSF-preprocessed subset of 406 ASD and 476 TC subjects (out of the full 1112-subject, 539 ASD/573 TC release); no explicit additional motion/QC exclusion rule stated in this paper. | quote: \"In this work we use the preprocessed data from the DPARSF pipeline [31] comprising 406 ASD and 476 TC subjects.\"" ;
