            slr:answer_text "associational — ABIDE I+II discovery sample, N=1019 (82 F ASD, 362 M ASD, 166 NT F, 409 NT M), 13 merged sites; QC rule: age 7-18, successful registration, FIQ 70-148, mFD within 3xIQR+Q3 (~0.39mm), sites with <3 datasets per diagnostic/sex group excluded | quote: \"The final ABIDE I and II dataset of N = 1019 included N = 82 females with autism, N = 362 males with autism, N = 166 neurotypical females (NT F), and N = 409 neurotypical males (NT M), aggregated across 13 sites.\"" ;
