            slr:answer_text "predictive — ABIDE (1112 raw, 1 excluded for preprocessing failure, 1111 final: 573 controls, 538 ASD) across 17 institutions; randomly split into label-balanced 889-subject training and 222-subject hold-out test sets | quote: \"Therefore, we divided the ABIDE dataset into training and test sets by ran- domly selecting a label-balanced 889 (4/5) of the ABIDE subjects as the training set, leaving the remaining 222 (1/5) ABIDE subjects as the testing set.\"" ;
