            slr:answer_text """ABIDE-I, single site (NYU), 184 subjects (79 ASD, 105 TC); no additional QC/exclusion rule beyond selecting the NYU site reported. | quote: "TABLE 2 | NYU phenotypic data information for ABIDE-I database.
