            slr:answer_text "CPAC pipeline (band-pass filtered 0.01-0.1Hz, no global signal regression), Harvard-Oxford atlas (110 ROIs). | quote: \"it is parcellated using the Harvard-Oxford (HO) atlas. After downloading the pre-processed data, 110 ROIs are acquired using the HO atlas.\"" ;
