            slr:answer_text "CONN toolbox/SPM12 pipeline (realignment, slice-timing, MNI normalization, 4mm smoothing, CompCor); cerebellar seed ROIs from the Diedrichsen probabilistic MR atlas of the human cerebellum, not a whole-brain parcellation. | quote: \"Seed ROIs in the cerebellum were created using the probabilistic MR Atlas of the human cerebellum\"" ;
