            slr:answer_text "CPAC (filter_noglobal) pipeline; AAL (116 ROIs) and CC200 atlases with Pearson-correlation connectivity. | quote: \"The mean time series from 116 regions of interest (ROIs) based on the automated anatomical labeling (AAL) atlas [23] are used for experiments.\"" ;
