            slr:answer_text "GRETNA v2.0.0 (SPM12-based) preprocessing (slice timing, realignment, MNI normalization, 6mm FWHM smoothing); AAL atlas, 24 spherical (6mm radius) ROIs across 7 networks. | quote: \"Data processing was performed with the GRETNA toolbox (v2.0.0) (Wang et al., 2015) based on SPM12.\"" ;
