            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1224 ;
            slr:answer_text "Leave-one-site-out inter-site cross-validation across all 17 sites; accuracy, sensitivity, specificity and F1 score reported; no stated statistical correction. | quote: \"we conduct inter-site cross-validation experiments on 17 sites from ABIDE database. Speciﬁcally, one site is left as the target domain for testing, and the remaining 16 sites as multiple source domains for training.\"" ;
