            slr:answer_text "Vertex-wise two-tailed t-tests via BrainStat with random field theory correction; cluster-wise correlations FDR-corrected (q<0.05); ComBat site harmonization used instead of leave-site-out. | quote: \"group differences between ASD and NT were  assessed in vertex-wise two-tailed Student’s t-tests using  the BrainStat toolbox\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ4> ;
