            slr:answer_text "Whole-brain seed-based GLM per seed, with site as a one-hot-encoded covariate in the ABIDE analysis; Bonferroni correction for five seeds (cluster threshold p=0.01); no leave-site-out evaluation | quote: \"To account for potential con- founding effects from differences in scan acquisition parameters, we included site as a covariate in our ABIDE GLM analysis as one-hot encoded variables.\"" ;
