            slr:source_id "S-052" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1238 ;
            slr:answer_text "DeepASD achieved accuracy 87.38±2.87%/AUC 92.76±4.00% on ABIDE A and accuracy 88.09±2.92%/AUC 93.59±2.45% on ABIDE B, outperforming 8 baselines by 13.25% accuracy, 7.69% AUC-ROC and 17.10% specificity; ablation showed the fMRI modality was the single most informative, with auxiliary modalities (phenotype, QC metrics, other atlases) further improving performance. | quote: \"The model achieved the following performance metrics, presented in mean ± standard deviation format, on the ABIDE A dataset: accuracy (ACC) of 87.38 ± 2.87%, area under curve (AUC) of 92.76 ± 4.00%, speciﬁcity (SEN) of 88.35 ± 6.83%, and sensitivity (SPE) of 86.51 ± 8.41%.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-066" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1213 ;
            slr:answer_text "Hyperconnectivity (ASD > TD) between right thalamus and right precentral gyrus (p=0.019) and right postcentral gyrus (p=0.028) in the ABIDE cohort, replicating the primary HFASD cohort's finding; other ABIDE clusters (insula, cuneus) did not match the primary cohort regions and did not correlate with clinical measures | quote: \"In the ABIDE GLM analysis, clusters were found that had greater connectivity with the right thalamus in the ASD group compared to the TD group. Two of these clusters were located in the right precentral (p = 0.019) and postcentral gyri (p = 0.028), validating the observed hyperconnectivity of the same regions in our HFASD cohort.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-007" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1166 ;
            slr:answer_text "Two abnormal connectivity subnetworks identified (middle temporal gyrus/precuneus; emotion/empathy-related k-partite network); SVM LOOCV accuracy 89% (RBF) / 84% (linear) | quote: \"The leave-one-out cross-validation results show that the accuracy rates are 89 and 84% correspondingly.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-078" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1261 ;
            slr:answer_text """Brain-wide hypoconnectivity (13,001 edges, 17.1%, pfwe<0.001) and hyperconnectivity (16,767 edges, 22%, pfwe<0.001) in autism; hypoconnectivity concentrated in sensory/somatomotor/attention networks, hyperconnectivity in DMN/subcortex | quote: "the NT>ASD contrast revealed 
