            slr:answer_text "DTL-NN outperformed DNN and SVM at all four sites, with the best result at USM (70.4% accuracy, 0.73 AUC) and an average across sites of 67.1% accuracy/0.71 AUC, significantly better than DNN for accuracy and sensitivity. | quote: \"The highest ASD classiﬁcation performance metrics were observed from the USM site−70.4% accuracy, 72.5% sensitivity, 67.0% speciﬁcity and 0.73 AUC.\"" ;
