            slr:answer_text "Augmentation gave only minor gains (best: 0.6 percentage points with early stopping, 2.2 with fixed epochs); half of augmentation strategies reduced accuracy; training accuracy >90% indicated overfitting | quote: \"Compared to no augmentation, the best augmentation approach increases the test accuracy by 0.6 percentage units.\"" ;
