0.802 ± 0.075
0.886 ± 0.062\"""" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-059" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1260 ;
            slr:answer_text "predictive — combined ABIDE-I+II: CNN 81.56% accuracy, DTL-NN 82.31% accuracy (no CI reported) | quote: \"ABIDE - I+II  CNN   81.56   81.5%   80.5%   88.0%   DTL-NN    82.31%   83.3%   80.7%   87.0%\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-004" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1229 ;
            slr:answer_text "Best model (>30 years age group) achieved ~95% accuracy, 97% sensitivity, 95% specificity; centrality measures (e.g., betweenness, eigenvector centrality) contributed most to classification across age groups. | quote: \"Our methodology achieved better results than most state-of-the-art investigations on this dataset with the best model for the >30 years age group achieving an accuracy, sensitivity, and speciﬁcity of 95, 97, and 95%, respectively.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
