        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1202 ;
            slr:answer_text """DMN functional connectivity was weaker in ASD than TD; DMN-derived biomarker A4 achieved AUC 0.745 in the local cohort (vs 0.590 for its RSN-template counterpart R4, p<0.05); DMN biomarkers correlated negatively with SRS severity. | quote: "The results of this study indicate that the FC of DMN in the ASD group was 
weaker than that of the TD group.\"""" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-091" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1227 ;
            slr:answer_text "ASD patients show increased dynamic FC variability in regions of low variability in controls; classification reached up to 65% accuracy (intra-site) and ~62% accuracy (inter-site, leave-one-site-out, MLP); no CI reported. | quote: \"achieved 65%\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-072" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1256 ;
            slr:answer_text "Without adaptation: 86.0% AUROC on ABIDE I, 79.2% AUROC on ABIDE II; with supervised domain adaptation: 93.2% (ABIDE-I) and 90.5% (ABIDE-II). Cerebellar connectivity identified as a reproducible discriminative feature. | quote: \"The top single model trained using IMPAC attained 80.4% AUROC on IMPAC held-out test data. When tested on ABIDE I, it achieved an AUROC of 86.0% (Table 2 underlined) and when tested on the ABIDE II it achieved a performance of 79.2%.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-010" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1177 ;
            slr:answer_text "ASD showed hypo-connectivity between pSTS and right IPL, left premotor area, fusiform gyrus and bilateral superior occipital gyrus, and hyper-connectivity between pSTS and left thalamus and right IFG, replicating the direction of the original sample's fronto-parietal hypoconnectivity finding. | quote: \"Similar to findings emerging from the original dataset, we observed a significant reduction in pSTS-iFC with right IPL and left premotor area in the ASD compared with the TD group. Reduced pSTS-iFC was also observed with the fusiform gyrus and bilateral superior oc- cipital gyrus (Figure 6; Supplementary Table S3). Stronger pSTS-iFC in the ASD group was observed with left thalamus and right IFG\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-026" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1226 ;
            slr:answer_text "predictive — 75.20% accuracy (82.90% sensitivity, 69.70% specificity) on whole ABIDE I (N=1035); 88.71% on the proposed subset (N=645); 96.40% on the NYU subset (N=175); 4.4-percentage-point improvement over prior best on the same whole-dataset benchmark | quote: \"Whole dataset 1,035 75.20 82.90 69.70 Proposed subset 645 88.71 81.82 92.50 NYU subset 175 96.40 91.00 99.50\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-014" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1196 ;
            slr:answer_text "Averaged test accuracy up to 74.8% (m=3), significantly outperforming the SFM structural-only baseline; frontal and temporal lobes identified as most predictive regions. | quote: \"m SFM (%) Ours (%) p-value 2 69.1 ± 7.4 73.5 ± 6.9 0.026 3 70.4 ± 10.3 74.8 ± 9.5 0.016\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-055" ],
        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1233 ;
            slr:answer_text "Of the 12 aberrant cerebellar-cerebral FCs found in the original (non-ABIDE) dataset, decreased FC between right dentate nucleus and left IPL replicated significantly in the ABIDE II sample (p=0.039), with a non-significant trend for vermis VI-left MFG (p=0.071) that did not survive Bonferroni correction. | quote: \"the ASD group showed signiﬁcantly decreased FC between the right dentate nucleus and left IPL (p = 0.039, Figure 4)\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:RQ5> ;
            slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
            slr:source_id "S-043" ] ;
    slr:question_id "RQ5" ;
    slr:question_text "What is the direction and scope of the main finding (e.g. hypo/hyper-connectivity, which networks; accuracy/AUC with CI)?" ;
    slr:theme "Claim" .

