            slr:answer_text "Yes | quote: \"After preprocessing (described in section 2.2.), the ABIDE I dataset was composed of 432 subjects with TD (348 males, mean age ± standard deviation of 18.21 ± 8.04) and 276 individuals with ASD (241 males, 18.42 ± 8.38). The ABIDE II dataset was composed of 316 subjects with TD (208 males, 12.80 ± 5.61) and 269 individuals with ASD (234 males, 13.93 ± 7.07).\"" ;
