        [ a slr:ChartingQuestionAnswer ;
            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1211 ;
            slr:answer_text """Yes — detailed, multi-step exclusion criteria with resulting N (395 ASD/425 TD). | quote: "After removing subjects based on these exclusion criteria, we were left with 395 subjects in the ASD group and 
