            slr:answer_text "Partly — N by diagnosis given (403 ASD/468 TC) but defined only by reuse of a prior subset, with no exclusion rule of its own. | quote: \"Of the 871 subjects, 403 patients were ASD and 468 were TC patients.\"" ;
