            slr:answer_text "Partly — inclusion rule and total N given exactly (1045 ABIDE I, 761 ABIDE II) with ASD% by Table 3, but exact integer counts by diagnosis are not given, only percentages. | quote: \"Participants from all sites of the ABIDE I and ABIDE II were included for external validation, provided both sMRI and rsfMRI were obtained on the same visit. The first avail- able pair of sMRI and rsfMRI scans were used per subject. 1045 subjects from ABIDE I and 761 subjects from ABIDE II met this criteria.\"" ;
