            slr:answer_text "Yes — training (ABIDE-I, 379 ASD/395 TD) and test (ABIDE-II, 163 ASD/230 TD) Ns reported with their respective QC rules. | quote: \"In our experiments, we used ABIDE-I subject data that passed manual qual- ity assessments (QA) by all the functional raters. This yielded a ﬁnal sample size of 774 ABIDE-I subjects, comprising 379 subjects with ASD and 395 typical con- trols.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:cl1-cohort-definition-reported-inclusion-exclusion-rules-and> ;
