            slr:about_source _:n8cdf5207cb25495c891b44af156133bfb1209 ;
            slr:answer_text "Partly — one subject excluded for a general preprocessing failure; no specific motion-metric (e.g. FD) threshold value is given in the main text | quote: \"We had to exclude one subject whose data could not be preprocessed with our preprocessing pipeline, leaving us with a dataset of 1111 individuals, including 573 healthy controls and 538 patients with autism.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:cl2-motion-qc-rule-reported-metric-and-threshold-e-g-mean-fd> ;
