            slr:answer_text "Yes — SPM12/DARTEL pipeline fully described | quote: \"Data presented in this study underwent standard fMRI pre- processing (i.e., realignment, normalization, and smoothing) implemented in SPM12b. Data were preprocessed according to standard SPM protocols including realignment, normalization to a study specific template using DARTEL, smoothing, band- pass filtering (0.01–0.05 Hz), and scrubbing to account for head movements (63).\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:cl3-preprocessing-pipeline-and-version-reported> ;
