            slr:answer_text "Yes — a leave-site-out evaluation was performed across all 17 ABIDE I sites in addition to pooled 10-fold CV. | quote: \"we used a leave-site-out approach for our proposed CNN, SVM, KNN, and RF classiﬁers (Heinsfeld et al., 2018). In this method, each site is taken as one fold in the dataset, and we applied a cross-validation approach on the remaining sites instead of diﬀerent folds. Therefore, each time, one site out of 17 is used to test, and the other sites are used for training.\"" ;
