            slr:answer_text "Yes — ComBat used to remove site/collection-time effects across ABIDE I and II data collections | quote: \"To account for site and collection time variability across each of the data collections in ABIDE I and II data repositories, site effects were removed using the ComBat function available in python [61] (https​://githu​b.com/ brent​p/comba​t.py). This approach has been shown to effectively account for scanner-related variance\"" ;
