            slr:answer_text "Yes | quote: \"We esti- mated the NeuroHarmonize model parameters on the entire cohort of control subjects, by specifying the age as a covariate, whose effect is to be preserved during the harmonization process. Finally, we applied the esti- mated model on the entire sample of subjects with ASD and TD controls.\"" ;
            slr:answers_question <urn:synthscholar:review:review_local_20261015_abide_rsfmri:question:cl6-site-handling-reported-site-covariate-harmonisation-e-g> ;
