            slr:answer_text "uses-data | quote: \"These included individuals with  autism spectrum disorders (ASD) and healthy-controls in shared data from the Autism Brain Imaging  Data Exchange (ABIDE) and the Attention-Deficit Hyperactivity Disorder (ADHD-200) databases.\"" ;
